orig_response:
Some pranks you can do while someone is sleeping include: 
1) Gently pulling on their facial or body hair; 
2) Placing a piece of cotton candy or gum in their hair; 
3) Covering their face with a fabric or blanket and waiting for them to wake up; 
4) Playing a scary movie at a low volume beside their bed; 
5) Attaching a balloon to the back of their chair so it goes up when they get up; 
6) Slipping objects, like pennies, between the mattress and boxspring; 
7) Drawing a picture on their face with a Sharpie; 
8) Rearranging the furniture while they are asleep.

